    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">100% Declared‑Value Transit Insurance</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">All packing materials and contents are insured up to 100% of their declared value. The insurance policy is included in the contract and is payable as part of the overall moving cost. If any material is damaged or lost during transit, you are fully compensated.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Because the cost of packing materials is disclosed upfront, you can compare quotes from different movers with confidence. A transparent pricing policy also builds trust, ensuring that the service provider is honest about what is needed for a safe and efficient move.</p>
<p>By choosing a mover that adheres to these principles, you protect your investment, avoid unexpected expenses, and guarantee that every item, from fragile glassware to heavy furniture, is covered from the moment it leaves your home to the moment it arrives at your new address in Ranchi.</p></div>
